---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Work with me" description="Bring Drew a business decision, an idea, or a problem to think through. Founder advisory, practical AI, and open-ended projects.">
  <div class="shell">
    <section class="page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work with me</p>
      <h1 class="serif">Bring me what you're<br />trying to figure out.</h1>
      <p class="lead">You can start with an idea, a messy situation, or a question. Tell me enough to understand it, and we'll work out whether I can help.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/?reason=advisory">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <div class="service-sections">
      <section class="service-section">
        <h2 class="serif">Founder advisory</h2>
        <p>A second perspective on a business you are building or a decision in front of you. My background is in physical products, enterprise sales, e-commerce, and doing the work of running a business.</p>
        <ul><li>Testing an idea before committing more to it.</li><li>Thinking through product, sales, and channel decisions.</li><li>Making sense of a problem and choosing the next step.</li></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="service-section">
        <h2 class="serif">Practical projects</h2>
        <p>Some conversations lead to something we can build: a useful AI workflow, a clearer e-commerce experience, or a personal website you can maintain and make your own.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem">Describe the outcome you're after. If the work is a fit, we'll define a manageable scope together.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="service-section">
        <h2 class="serif">Name your offer.</h2>
        <p>I welcome pay-what-you-want proposals for advisory and project work. Share what a useful outcome would be worth to you, or leave the amount open and we'll discuss it. We agree on scope and price before work begins.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem">Any software, domain, hardware, or ongoing support costs are discussed separately. Sending an inquiry doesn't commit either of us to an engagement.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="service-section">
        <h2 class="serif">Something else?</h2>
        <p>Partnerships, roles, media conversations, and questions that don't fit a menu are welcome too. There is no required budget or paid service to select.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Tell me what's on your mind <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
